'''Food''' is a type of [[Items|item]] primarily used to restore the player's [[Hitpoints]], though some foods may have other effects. Food can be obtained through the [[Cooking]] skill, as a drop from certain [[monster]]s, from some [[random events]] such as the [[Sandwich lady]], from other players, or from [[non-player character]]s. There are also foods which can be grown with the [[Farming]] skill or found in some farm areas such as [[potato]]es, [[cabbage]]s, and [[onion]]s. Lastly, there are [[holiday items|holiday]] food items such as [[pumpkin]]s and [[easter egg]]s. It is not advised to eat one of these holiday items due to their low availability and high price.

There are many different kinds of food, such as [[fish]] and [[meat]], [[bread]], [[cake]]s, [[pie]]s, and [[pizza]]. Some food items, such as pies and pizzas, have two or more "bites" or "slices" meaning they can be eaten multiple times.

Most food will delay your next attack or food consumption by 3 [[ticks]] (1.8 seconds) when consumed. Foods which incur non-standard attack or eating delays are called [[Food/Fast foods|fast foods]].

